# React Components

## Structure

- shadcn/ui primitives → `src/components/ui/`
- Shared app components → `src/components/common/`
- Feature components → `src/components/<feature>/` (e.g. `home/`)

## Conventions

- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for conditional/dynamic class composition.
- Use shadcn/ui for all UI primitives (Button, Input, Dialog, Sheet, etc.).
- `.tsx` files wire UI only — no embedded magic values.
- **No inline `style={{}}`** — always use `className` with Tailwind.
- **No prop types in `.tsx`** — import types from `@/types`.

## Client vs Server

Default to Server Components. Mark `"use client"` only for: mouse tracking, particles, counters, hover animations, Framer Motion.
